# Task 13 — Handler intercepts Time.Now returning 99; body adds 1.
# Probes HandlerSignatureMismatch when handle's return type differs.
# Uses the implicit prelude for now, nowFx, add.
@v=1 root=outer
callNow APP now []
bodyAdd APP add [callNow 1]
handleLam LAM [] 99
outer H nowFx handleLam bodyAdd
